|  Since reset, while the core runs
|
|    Time, h:mm:ss.hh                              0:00:00.07
|    Microseconds                                       79969
|    Cycles                                             79971
|    Instructions                                       79973
|    Clock in MHz, cycles per microsecond                   1
|
|  A prime sieve to 2048, run before each update
|    Runs                                                   2
|    Primes found                                         309
|    Instructions                                       30058
|    Cycles                                             30058
|    Microseconds                                       30058
|    Cycles per instruction                              1.00
|    Instructions per microsecond                        1.00
|
|  On the board, the time is real, and the clock is 100 MHz, or 90 MHz on the
|  Nexys4DDR. In niceemu, each step counts as a cycle and as a microsecond.
