Screen:
| NiceMonMEGA65 V9.9                            the 32-bit NICE CPU of B. Ulmann
| F1 typewriter   F3 key codes   F5 charset   F7 counters   F9 comet   F11 board
|
|  A self-test, which runs each time that F11 starts it
|
|    RAM, FFFF8000 to FFFFEFFF                     PASS
|    Math unit, multiply and divide                PASS
|    Timer, 10 interrupts every 1000 cycles        PASS
|    Performance counters                          PASS
|
|  All tests passed.
|
|  A failure shows where it failed and what was read: an address and its word,
|  or for the timer, the interrupts that came and the cycles that they took.
|
|  The Ethernet station, 0xFFFFFF98 to 0xFFFFFF9D
|  IP address            0.0.0.0
|  MAC address           00:00:00:00:00:00
|  Good frames received           0
|  Bad or dropped frames          0
|  Frames sent                    0
|
|  I types a new IP address, and M a new MAC address.
